<view class="container">
  <view class="card muted">
    对应设计稿「罐表设置」画板：按罐体形状输入物理尺寸，本地计算出一张液位→容积换算表再下发给设备。
    协议里没有下发整张表的方法，"生成罐表"这里只做本地演示计算，不代表真实换算公式已确认。
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">选择罐体形状</view>
    <view class="shape-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{shapes}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="shape-card {{activeShape === item.key ? 'shape-card-active' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onShapeTap"
      >
        <image class="shape-glyph" src="/assets/icons/{{item.icon}}.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text>{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">罐号（生成后绑定到哪个物理罐）</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{tankOptions}}" value="{{tankIndex}}" bindchange="onTankChange">
        <view class="field-input">{{tankOptions[tankIndex] || '请选择'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="field" wx:for="{{dims}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="field-label">{{item.label}}（毫米）</text>
      <input class="field-input" type="digit" value="{{item.value}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="onDimInput" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{previewRows.length > 0}}">
    <view class="section-title">示例换算表（本地演示数据，非真实结果）</view>
    <view class="row tabular-nums" wx:for="{{previewRows}}" wx:key="level" style="padding:8rpx 0;">
      <text class="muted">液位 {{item.level}}mm</text>
      <text class="muted">容积 {{item.volume}}L</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="row" style="gap:16rpx;">
    <button class="btn-secondary" style="flex:1;" bindtap="onGenerate">生成罐表</button>
  </view>
  <view class="row" style="gap:16rpx;margin-top:16rpx;">
    <button class="btn-primary" style="flex:1;" bindtap="onSaveLocal">保存到手机</button>
    <button class="btn-secondary" style="flex:1;" bindtap="onSaveDevice">保存到控制器</button>
  </view>
</view>
